# Architecture

This project uses a small Python package with a `src/` layout and the **{{ profile }}** profile.
Application code is independent of the generator that created this repository.

{% if profile == "minimal" %}The minimal profile keeps one direct entrypoint in `main.py` and is
intentionally free of speculative layers.
{% else %}The entrypoint and `bootstrap.py` compose the application service. The application layer
depends inward on domain code; the service profile additionally exposes a small console adapter
that depends on the application layer. The structure is framework-neutral and deliberately tiny.
{% endif %}
